(sysmodule_internal.cpp), so the Modules line and its tooltip count 25 that shadPS4 cannot do without. The rest of
what the app relies on is unchanged from 0.20.0: shadPS4's own folder, the -UPDATE, -patch and -mods folders,
shadNet's protocol 1, its default server and the sign-in, the settings keys and their defaults (0.21.0 adds two the
app leaves alone), the users, the play time and the quit hotkeys.

